      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef isValid(word):\n    # Check if length is at least 3\n    if len(word) < 3:\n        return False\n    \n    # Check if word contains only digits and English letters\n    for char in word:\n        if not (char.isalpha() or char.isdigit()):\n            return False\n    \n    # Define vowels\n    vowels = set('aeiouAEIOU')\n    \n    # Check for at least one vowel and one consonant\n    has_vowel = False\n    has_consonant = False\n    \n    for char in word:\n        if char.isalpha():\n            if char in vowels:\n                has_vowel = True\n            else:\n                has_consonant = True\n    \n    # Return true if both vowel and consonant are present\n    return has_vowel and has_consonant\n```",
