      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef numberOfSpecialChars(word):\n    lower_set = set()\n    upper_set = set()\n    \n    # Separate lowercase and uppercase letters\n    for char in word:\n        if char.islower():\n            lower_set.add(char)\n        else:\n            upper_set.add(char.lower())\n    \n    # Count letters that appear in both lowercase and uppercase\n    special_count = 0\n    for char in lower_set:\n        if char in upper_set:\n            special_count += 1\n    \n    return special_count\n```",
