      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom itertools import accumulate\n\ndef solve():\n    t = int(input())\n    \n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(input())\n        a = list(map(int, input().split()))\n        \n        # Precompute prefix sums for efficient range sum queries\n        prefix = [0] + list(accumulate(a))\n        \n        def get_sum(l, r):\n            return prefix[r + 1] - prefix[l]\n        \n        max_diff = 0\n        \n        # Try every possible k from 1 to n\n        for k in range(1, n + 1):\n            if n % k != 0:\n                continue  # Skip if we can't divide boxes evenly into groups of size k\n            \n            num_trucks = n // k\n            if num_trucks == 1:\n                # Only one truck, difference is 0\n                truck_weights = [get_sum(0, n - 1)]\n            else:\n                truck_weights = []\n                for i in range(num_trucks):\n                    start = i * k\n                    end = start + k - 1\n                    truck_weights.append(get_sum(start, end))\n            \n            min_weight = min(truck_weights)\n            max_weight = max(truck_weights)\n            diff = max_weight - min_weight\n            max_diff = max(max_diff, diff)\n        \n        print(max_diff)\n\nsolve()\n```",
