      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    N, K = map(int, input().split())\n    A = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    \n    starts = 0\n    empty_seats = K\n    queue = A[:]\n    \n    while queue:\n        if empty_seats < queue[0]:\n            # Start the attraction\n            starts += 1\n            empty_seats = K  # Reset empty seats after starting\n        else:\n            # Guide the front group to the attraction\n            group_size = queue.pop(0)\n            empty_seats -= group_size\n    \n    # One final start is needed to run the attraction with remaining people\n    if empty_seats < K:\n        starts += 1\n    \n    print(starts)\n\nsolve()\n```",
