      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve():\n    H, W = map(int, input().split())\n    grid = []\n    start = None\n    goal = None\n    \n    for i in range(H):\n        row = input().strip()\n        grid.append(row)\n        for j in range(W):\n            if row[j] == 'S':\n                start = (i, j)\n            elif row[j] == 'T':\n                goal = (i, j)\n    \n    N = int(input())\n    medicines = {}\n    for _ in range(N):\n        r, c, e = map(int, input().split())\n        # Convert to 0-indexed\n        medicines[(r-1, c-1)] = e\n    \n    # BFS with state (row, col, energy)\n    # We'll keep track of the maximum energy we've had at each cell\n    max_energy = {}\n    queue = deque()\n    \n    # Start with 0 energy at the start position\n    queue.append((start[0], start[1], 0))\n    max_energy[(start[0], start[1])] = 0\n    \n    while queue:\n        r, c, energy = queue.popleft()\n        \n        # If we've reached the goal\n        if (r, c) == goal:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n            return\n            \n        # If current energy is less than or equal to 0, can't move\n        if energy <= 0:\n            continue\n            \n        # Check if we can use medicine at current position\n        if (r, c) in medicines:\n            new_energy = medicines[(r, c)]\n            if ((r, c) not in max_energy) or (max_energy[(r, c)] < new_energy):\n                max_energy[(r, c)] = new_energy\n                queue.append((r, c, new_energy))\n        \n        # Try to move in 4 directions\n        for dr, dc in [(0, 1), (0, -1), (1, 0), (-1, 0)]:\n            nr, nc = r + dr, c + dc\n            \n            # Check if new position is valid\n            if 0 <= nr < H and 0 <= nc < W and grid[nr][nc] != '#':\n                new_energy = energy - 1\n                if new_energy > 0:  # Can move only if we have energy left\n                    state = (nr, nc)\n                    if (state not in max_energy) or (max_energy[state] < new_energy):\n                        max_energy[state] = new_energy\n                        queue.append((nr, nc, new_energy))\n    \n    print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
