 the ratings of the three users is 13. Sorting their names in lexicographical order yields aoki, snuke, takahashi, so aoki is assigned number 0, snuke is 1, and takahashi is 2.\nSince 13 \\bmod 3 = 1, print snuke, who is assigned number 1.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n3\ntakahashi 2813\ntakahashixx 1086\ntakahashix 4229\n\nSample Output 2\n\ntakahashix",
