      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solution(x):\n    # Calculate the sum of digits\n    digit_sum = sum(int(digit) for digit in str(x))\n    \n    # Check if x is divisible by the sum of its digits\n    if x % digit_sum == 0:\n        return digit_sum\n    else:\n        return -1\n```",
