    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef main():\n    # Read input\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    # Parse first line\n    N = int(data[0])\n    M = int(data[1])\n    K = int(data[2])\n    \n    # Build graph\n    graph = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    index = 3\n    for _ in range(M):\n        a = int(data[index])\n        b = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        graph[a].append(b)\n        graph[b].append(a)\n    \n    # Read guards\n    guards = []\n    for _ in range(K):\n        p = int(data[index])\n        h = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        guards.append((p, h))\n    \n    # Find all guarded vertices using BFS from each guard\n    guarded = set()\n    \n    for start_vertex, stamina in guards:\n        # BFS from start_vertex with max distance = stamina\n        if stamina == 0:\n            guarded.add(start_vertex)\n            continue\n            \n        visited = [False] * (N + 1)\n        queue = deque([(start_vertex, 0)])  # (vertex, distance)\n        visited[start_vertex] = True\n        guarded.add(start_vertex)\n        \n        while queue:\n            vertex, dist = queue.popleft()\n            \n            # If we've reached the stamina limit, don't explore further\n            if dist == stamina:\n                continue\n                \n            # Explore neighbors\n            for neighbor in graph[vertex]:\n                if not visited[neighbor]:\n                    visited[neighbor] = True\n                    queue.append((neighbor, dist + 1))\n                    guarded.add(neighbor)\n    \n    # Output result\n    guarded_vertices = sorted(list(guarded))\n    print(len(guarded_vertices))\n    if guarded_vertices:\n        print(' '.join(map(str, guarded_vertices)))\n\nmain()\n```",
