      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef shortestSubstrings(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    answer = [\"\"] * n\n    \n    # For each string in the array\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_string = arr[i]\n        found = False\n        min_length = float('inf')\n        \n        # Generate all substrings of current string, ordered by length then lexicographically\n        candidates = []\n        for length in range(1, len(current_string) + 1):\n            for start in range(len(current_string) - length + 1):\n                substr = current_string[start:start + length]\n                candidates.append(substr)\n        \n        # Sort by length first, then lexicographically\n        candidates.sort(key=lambda x: (len(x), x))\n        \n        # Check each candidate substring\n        for substr in candidates:\n            # Check if this substring appears in any other string\n            is_unique = True\n            for j in range(n):\n                if i != j and substr in arr[j]:\n                    is_unique = False\n                    break\n            \n            if is_unique:\n                answer[i] = substr\n                found = True\n                break\n    \n    return answer\n```",
