      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    N = int(input())\n    D = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    \n    count = 0\n    \n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        month_str = str(i)\n        for j in range(1, D[i-1] + 1):\n            day_str = str(j)\n            # Check if all digits in month and day are the same\n            all_digits = month_str + day_str\n            if all(d == all_digits[0] for d in all_digits):\n                count += 1\n    \n    print(count)\n\nsolve()\n```",
