e same price and functions.\n\nSample Input 3\n\n20 10\r\n72036 3 3 4 9\r\n7716 4 1 2 3 6\r\n54093 5 1 6 7 8 10\r\n25517 7 3 4 5 6 7 9 10\r\n96930 8 2 3 4 6 7 8 9 10\r\n47774 6 2 4 5 6 7 9\r\n36959 5 1 3 4 5 8\r\n46622 7 1 2 3 5 6 8 10\r\n34315 9 1 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 10\r\n54129 7 1 3 4 6 7 8 9\r\n4274 5 2 4 7 9 10\r\n16578 5 2 3 6 7 9\r\n61809 4 1 2 4 5\r\n1659 5 3 5 6 9 10\r\n59183 5 1 2 3 4 9\r\n22186 4 3 5 6 8\r\n98282 4 1 4 7 10\r\n72865 8 1 2 3 4 6 8 9 10\r\n33796 6 1 3 5 7 9 10\r\n74670 4 1 2 6 8\n\nSample Output 3\n\nYes",
