      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    from itertools import combinations\n    \n    # Read input\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split()\n    if not data:\n        print(-1)\n        return\n        \n    # Parse first line\n    N = int(data[0])\n    K = int(data[1])\n    P = int(data[2])\n    \n    # Parse development plans\n    plans = []\n    index = 3\n    for i in range(N):\n        cost = int(data[index])\n        A = list(map(int, data[index+1:index+1+K]))\n        plans.append((cost, A))\n        index += K + 1\n    \n    # Try all possible combinations of plans\n    min_cost = float('inf')\n    found = False\n    \n    # Try all subsets of plans\n    for r in range(1, N + 1):\n        for combo in combinations(range(N), r):\n            # Calculate total parameters and cost for this combination\n            total_params = [0] * K\n            total_cost = 0\n            \n            for plan_idx in combo:\n                cost, A = plans[plan_idx]\n                total_cost += cost\n                for j in range(K):\n                    total_params[j] += A[j]\n            \n            # Check if all parameters meet the target P\n            if all(param >= P for param in total_params):\n                found = True\n                min_cost = min(min_cost, total_cost)\n    \n    if found:\n        print(min_cost)\n    else:\n        print(-1)\n\nsolve()\n```",
