      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef punishmentNumber(n):\n    def can_partition(s, target, start):\n        if start == len(s):\n            return target == 0\n        \n        for i in range(start + 1, len(s) + 1):\n            num = int(s[start:i])\n            if num <= target and can_partition(s, target - num, i):\n                return True\n        return False\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        square = i * i\n        square_str = str(square)\n        if can_partition(square_str, i, 0):\n            total += square\n    \n    return total\n```",
