      "generated_answer": "def solve(k, x):\n    def price_sum_up_to(num):\n        total_price = 0\n        bit_pos = x\n        while (1 << (bit_pos - 1)) <= num:\n            block_size = 1 << bit_pos\n            full_blocks = num // block_size\n            count = full_blocks * (1 << (bit_pos - 1))\n            remainder = num % block_size\n            if remainder >= (1 << (bit_pos - 1)):\n                count += remainder - (1 << (bit_pos - 1)) + 1\n            total_price += count\n            bit_pos += x\n        return total_price\n\n    left, right = 0, k * x\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right + 1) // 2\n        if price_sum_up_to(mid) <= k:\n            left = mid\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    return left",
