 3 distinct elements in the prefix and no elements in the suffix. Thus, diff[4] = 3 - 0 = 3.\n\n \nConstraints:\n\n1 <= n == nums.length <= 50\n1 <= nums[i] <= 50",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
