      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    result = []\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        # Calculate distinct elements in prefix nums[0, ..., i]\n        prefix_distinct = len(set(nums[:i+1]))\n        \n        # Calculate distinct elements in suffix nums[i+1, ..., n-1]\n        suffix_distinct = len(set(nums[i+1:])) if i+1 < n else 0\n        \n        # Calculate difference\n        diff = prefix_distinct - suffix_distinct\n        result.append(diff)\n    \n    return result\n```",
