n a row.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n5 1\r\naaaaa\r\n1 5\n\nSample Output 2\n\n4\r\n\nS_1S_2\\ldots S_5 =  aaaaa has four places where the same lowercase English letter occurs twice in a row:\r\nS_1S_2 =  aa, S_2S_3 =  aa, S_3S_4 =  aa, and S_4S_5 =  aa.",
