e to next a: remove value `a`, add value `a + k` (if within bounds and not last)\n        if a < total_windows:\n            # Remove value `a`\n            p_remove = pos[a]\n            valid[p_remove] = False\n            \n            # Add value `a + k`\n            p_add = pos[a + k]\n            valid[p_add] = True\n            heapq.heappush(min_heap, p_add)\n            heapq.heappush(max_heap, -p_add)\n    \n    print(best)\n\nmain()\n```\n\nWe can run this.\n\nIt should handle all cases.\n\nLet’s call it.",
