      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    \n    # Read input\n    N, M = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n    A = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    \n    # Convert to set for O(1) lookup\n    firework_days = set(A)\n    \n    # For each day i from 1 to N\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        if i in firework_days:\n            print(0)\n        else:\n            # Find the next firework day after day i\n            next_firework = 0\n            for day in A:\n                if day >= i:\n                    next_firework = day\n                    break\n            print(next_firework - i)\n\nsolve()\n```",
