      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef matrixSum(nums):\n    score = 0\n    \n    # Continue until the matrix becomes empty\n    while nums[0]:  # While the first row still has elements\n        removed_from_rows = []\n        \n        # Step 1: From each row, select and remove the largest number\n        for row in nums:\n            if row:  # Make sure the row is not empty\n                max_num = max(row)\n                row.remove(max_num)\n                removed_from_rows.append(max_num)\n        \n        # Step 2: Identify the highest number amongst all removed\n        if removed_from_rows:\n            highest_removed = max(removed_from_rows)\n            score += highest_removed\n    \n    return score\n```",
