    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxPartitionsAfterOperations(s, k):\n    n = len(s)\n    \n    # Function to calculate partitions for a given string\n    def count_partitions(string):\n        if not string:\n            return 0\n        partitions = 0\n        i = 0\n        while i < len(string):\n            partitions += 1\n            distinct = set()\n            j = i\n            while j < len(string) and len(distinct) <= k:\n                distinct.add(string[j])\n                if len(distinct) <= k:\n                    j += 1\n                else:\n                    break\n            # Back up if we exceeded k\n            if len(distinct) > k:\n                j -= 1\n            i = j\n        return partitions\n    \n    # Base case: no changes\n    max_partitions = count_partitions(s)\n    \n    # Try changing each position to each possible lowercase letter\n    for i in range(n):\n        original_char = s[i]\n        for c in 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz':\n            if c == original_char:\n                continue\n            # Create new string with character changed\n            new_s = s[:i] + c + s[i+1:]\n            partitions = count_partitions(new_s)\n            max_partitions = max(max_partitions, partitions)\n    \n    return max_partitions\n```",
