      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solution(nums):\n    # Count frequency of each number\n    freq = {}\n    for num in nums:\n        freq[num] = freq.get(num, 0) + 1\n    \n    # Find numbers that appear twice and XOR them\n    result = 0\n    for num, count in freq.items():\n        if count == 2:\n            result ^= num\n    \n    return result\n```",
