      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumSumQueries(nums1, nums2, queries):\n    n = len(nums1)\n    # Create pairs of (nums1[i], nums2[i]) and sort by nums1 in descending order\n    pairs = sorted([(nums1[i], nums2[i]) for i in range(n)], key=lambda x: -x[0])\n    \n    # For each query, find the maximum sum\n    result = []\n    \n    for x, y in queries:\n        max_sum = -1\n        # Check each pair to find valid indices\n        for num1, num2 in pairs:\n            if num1 >= x and num2 >= y:\n                max_sum = max(max_sum, num1 + num2)\n        result.append(max_sum)\n    \n    return result\n```",
