    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Consider that the following two signals: $x(t)$ and $v(t)$ $$ x(t)=\\left\\{{\\begin{{array}}{{cc}} 1 & 0 \\leq t \\leq 3 \\\\ 0 & \\text {{ otherwise }} \\end{{array}} \\quad v(t)=\\left\\{{\\begin{{array}}{{cc}} 1 & 0 \\leq t \\leq 2 \\\\ 0 & \\text {{ otherwise }} \\end{{array}}\\right.\\right. $$ Let $y(\\tau)=\\int_{{-\\infty}}^{{\\infty}} x(\\tau-t) v(t) d t$. Let $\\tau=2.5$. Determine $y(\\tau)$.\n\nOptions: \nA. 3\nB. 2.5\nC. 2\nD. 1.75\nE. 0.5\nF. 3.5\nG. 0\nH. 1\nI. 1.5\nJ. 4\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
