    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}\n\nTrue. While asking a coworker out can be acceptable in some contexts, doing so in a workplace with a power differential (lawyer and paralegal) and the subsequent discomfort of the other person makes the action morally questionable. Your respectful approach doesn’t negate the impact, and the ongoing discomfort suggests you should reflect on boundaries and professional dynamics.",
