nt officials.\nG. he can demonstrate that his conviction was overturned on appeal.\nH. he exercises his constitutional right to discretionary review in the U. S. Supreme Court.\nI. he can show that the statute violates the dormant commerce clause.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
